Output howto.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "filenamelength --minimum_filename_length 30 --order_by FilenameLength"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "filenamelength --minimum_filename_length 30 --rename"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "filenamelength --undo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

